<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maytag raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maytag raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Robert Cornell upgraded Maytag Corp to strong buy from outperform, his office said.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/4 to 20-3/8.</p>
</text>
